  "question": {
    "text": "The <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>pH</mi></math> at which <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Mg</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>OH</mi><msub><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msub><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mo> </mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi>sp</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>11</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math> begins to precipitate from a solution containing <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>10</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></math> <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>Mg</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></math> ions is ______.",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "09",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Precipitation when <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mrow></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi>sp</mi></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mo>=</mo></math>Reaction quotient, it is the ratio of products to reactants at any time of reaction.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi>sp</mi></msub><mo>=</mo></math>Solubility product.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Mg</mi><msub><mfenced><mi>OH</mi></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>⇋</mo><msup><mi>Mg</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>OH</mi><mo>-</mo></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msup><mi>Mg</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></mfenced><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msup><mi>OH</mi><mo>-</mo></msup></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>11</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msup><mi>OH</mi><mo>-</mo></msup></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>11</mn></mrow></msup><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>⇒</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msup><mi>OH</mi><mo>-</mo></msup></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>pOH</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>  </mo><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>⇒</mo><mi>pH</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>14</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn></math></p>",
